OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over 'major dust cloud'
OL,4,Aon resurfaced road
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents near a busy dual carriageway
OL,7,Fthat is under maintenance have raised
OL,8,Fconcerns about "a visible major dust
OL,9,Fcloud".
OL,11,FA temporary 20mph speed limit has been
OL,12,Fput in place on the A3049 Dorset Way in
OL,13,FPoole, between Holes Bay roundabout and
OL,14,FMannings Heath roundabout.
OL,16,FA resident said the roadworks were
OL,17,F"causing a major health hazard" as the
OL,18,Fstreet had "a covering of white dust".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
