OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over 'major dust cloud'
OL,4,Aon resurfaced road
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Andy Hadley, from
OL,7,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,8,F(BCP) Council, apologised and urged
OL,9,Fdrivers to stick to the speed limit to
OL,10,Freduce the amount of dust in the air.
